1:["$","main",null,{"className":"reading-page post-reading-page","children":["$","article",null,{"className":"post-article h-entry","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"className":"u-url sr-only","href":"/blog/kafka/kafka-load-balance","children":["Kafka 负载均衡挑战及解决思路"," 永久链接"]}],["$","a",null,{"className":"p-author h-card sr-only","href":"https://github.com/hedon954","rel":"author","children":"Hedon"}],["$","figure",null,{"className":"article-hero article-cover","children":["$","img",null,{"className":"u-photo","src":"https://hedon.top/hedonspace/banner/kafka-load-balance.jpg","alt":"Kafka 负载均衡挑战及解决思路 的文章封面"}]}],["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header article-summary-row","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"Kafka"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"p-name","children":"Kafka 负载均衡挑战及解决思路"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"article-deck p-summary","children":"本文转载自 Agoda Enginnering, 介绍了 Kafka 负载均衡的实际应用过程中的负载均衡挑战及解决思路。"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-meta","children":[["$","time",null,{"className":"dt-published","dateTime":"2024-05-20T10:37:10.000Z","children":["发布于 ","2024/05/20"]}],"$undefined",["$","span",null,{"children":"$undefined"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["约 ","3,013"," 字"]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-layout","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-column","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"e-content","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"markdown-body","children":[["$","p","p-0",{"children":"本文转载自 Agoda Engineering，介绍了在实际应用中，如何应对 Kafka 负载均衡所遇到的各种挑战，并提出相应的解决思路。本文简要阐述了 Kafka 的并行性机制、常用的分区策略以及在实际操作中遇到的异构硬件、不均匀工作负载等问题。通过深入分析这些挑战，并提供具体的解决方案，本文旨在帮助读者更好地理解和应用 Kafka 的负载均衡技术，从而提高系统的整体性能和稳定性。"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":["以下大部分内容翻译自原文 ",["$","a","a-0",{"href":"https://medium.com/agoda-engineering/how-we-solve-load-balancing-challenges-in-apache-kafka-8cd88fdad02b","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://medium.com/agoda-engineering/how-we-solve-load-balancing-challenges-in-apache-kafka-8cd88fdad02b"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"how-we-solve-load-balancing-challenges-in-apache-kafka","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":15,"offset":209},"end":{"line":3,"column":69,"offset":263}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":14,"offset":208},"end":{"line":3,"column":176,"offset":370}}},"target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":"how-we-solve-load-balancing-challenges-in-apache-kafka"}],"，并已获得原作者同意。"]}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-0",{"id":"思维导图","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#思维导图","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#思维导图"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"思维导图","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":4,"offset":386},"end":{"line":5,"column":8,"offset":390}}}]},"children":"思维导图"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":["$","$L8","img-0",{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img/Kafka%20%E8%B4%9F%E8%BD%BD%E5%9D%87%E8%A1%A1%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%88.png","alt":"Kafka 负载均衡解决方案","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"img","properties":{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img/Kafka%20%E8%B4%9F%E8%BD%BD%E5%9D%87%E8%A1%A1%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%88.png","alt":"Kafka 负载均衡解决方案"},"children":[],"position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1,"offset":392},"end":{"line":7,"column":155,"offset":546}}}}]}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-1",{"id":"kafka-并行性","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#kafka-并行性","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#kafka-并行性"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Kafka 并行性","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":4,"offset":551},"end":{"line":9,"column":13,"offset":560}}}]},"children":"Kafka 并行性"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-3",{"children":"Kafka 通过分区来实现并行性，如下图所示，生产者（Producer）产生的消息会按照一定的分区策略分配到多个分区（Partition）中，消费组中的每个消费者会分别负责消费其中的若干个分区。"}],"\n",["$","p","p-4",{"children":["$","$L8","img-0",{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img/0*ixosAmhBDsyBBhoS.png","alt":"Kafka 分区演示","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"img","properties":{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img/0*ixosAmhBDsyBBhoS.png","alt":"Kafka 分区演示"},"children":[],"position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1,"offset":661},"end":{"line":13,"column":89,"offset":749}}}}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-5",{"children":"分区策略："}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":"轮询（Round Robin）：默认情况下，Kafka 使用轮询策略将消息均匀地分配到所有分区。"}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":"哈希（Key Hashing）：如果消息有分区键，Kafka 会对键进行哈希计算，将消息分配到特定的分区。"}],"\n","$L9","\n"]}],"\n","$La","\n","$Lb","\n","$Lc","\n","$Ld","\n","$Le","\n","$Lf","\n","$L10","\n","$L11","\n","$L12","\n","$L13","\n","$L14","\n","$L15","\n","$L16","\n","$L17","\n","$L18","\n","$L19","\n","$L1a","\n","$L1b","\n","$L1c","\n","$L1d","\n","$L1e","\n","$L1f","\n","$L20","\n","$L21","\n","$L22","\n","$L23","\n","$L24","\n","$L25","\n","$L26","\n","$L27","\n","$L28","\n","$L29","\n","$L2a","\n","$L2b","\n","$L2c","\n","$L2d","\n","$L2e","\n","$L2f","\n","$L30","\n","$L31","\n","$L32","\n","$L33","\n","$L34","\n","$L35","\n","$L36","\n","$L37","\n","$L38","\n","$L39","\n","$L3a","\n","$L3b","\n","$L3c"]}]}],"$L3d","$L3e","$L3f"]}],"$L40"]}]]}]}]
